OL,3,AInside Yemen's front-line city as
OL,4,AHouthis battle for control
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is the first drone," said the
OL,7,Fsoldier accompanying us in
OL,8,Fsouth-western Yemen. "It's usually
OL,9,Ffollowed by an attack."
OL,11,FThe buzzing sound overhead got louder
OL,12,Fas we took cover under the bushes,
OL,13,Fbefore climbing back into the vehicle
OL,14,Fand driving away.
OL,16,FWithin about 10 minutes, the loud thuds
OL,17,Fof strikes followed, one after another,
OL,18,Fthough it was unclear where they
OL,19,Flanded.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
